#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.shift.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.shift"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.shift:1 of
msgid "Shift rows within each group by ``periods`` positions."
msgstr "在每个组内将行移动 ``periods`` 个位置。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.shift.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.shift:3 of
msgid "Number of positions to shift within each group."
msgstr "在每个组内移动的位置数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.shift:5 of
msgid "Value to fill positions introduced by shifting."
msgstr "用于填充由移动引入的位置的值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.shift:7 of
msgid "Column(s) to shift.  If None, all non-group-key columns are shifted."
msgstr "要移动的列。如果为 None，则所有非分组键列都会被移动。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.shift.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.shift:10 of
msgid ""
"Shifted LiteFrame with the same shape (row count preserved). Output "
"dtypes follow the same rules as standalone ``shift``: they depend on the "
"input dtype and ``fill_value`` (columns may be widened when a non-null "
"``fill_value`` is supplied)."
msgstr ""
"具有相同形状的移动后 LiteFrame（行数保持不变）。输出数据类型遵循独立 ``"
"shift`` 的相同规则：它们取决于输入数据类型和 ``fill_value``（当提供非空 `"
"`fill_value`` 时，列可能会被扩展）。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.shift.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.shift:17 of
msgid "备注"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.shift:19 of
msgid ""
"Grouped transforms hash-shuffle rows by group key, so the output row "
"order follows reducer/hash-partition order and is **not** aligned with "
"the input frame (unlike pandas, which preserves the index). Row count is "
"preserved. Order restoration via a place-back operator "
"(``LiteFrameIlocSetItem``) is planned; see "
"``docs/designs/liteframe/operators/window.md``."
msgstr ""
"分组转换通过分组键对行进行哈希洗牌，因此输出行顺序遵循 reducer/哈希分区"
"顺序，并且与输入框架**不**对齐（不像 pandas 那样保留索引）。行数保持不变"
"。计划通过 place-back 操作符（``LiteFrameIlocSetItem``）进行顺序恢复；"
"参见 ``docs/designs/liteframe/operators/window.md``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.shift:26 of
msgid ""
"Null-key rows are preserved with a null result (matching pandas "
"``groupby.shift()`` under the default ``dropna=True``); they are not "
"grouped together."
msgstr ""
"空键行会保留并产生空结果（匹配 pandas 在默认 ``dropna=True`` 下的 ``"
"groupby.shift()``）；它们不会被分组在一起。"

